{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat dispatch_log.txt'","aggregated_output":"Dispatch office log export -- week of 2026-09-14\nPrepared by night shift. Mixed sources: the dispatcher daemon log, the shift notes,\nand the manual table kept on the whiteboard. Only shipments that physically left the\ndock count as dispatched. Planned or voided shipments do not count.\n\n== daemon log ==\n2026-09-14T11:05:14Z WARN  label printer p14 low on paper\n2026-09-14T15:12:21Z INFO  queue depth=27\n2026-09-22T06:32:30Z DEBUG gc pause 32ms\n2026-09-22T15:16:00Z INFO  queue depth=59\n2026-09-14T19:57:39Z INFO  sync inventory batch=1 rows=0\n2026-09-14T13:58:41Z INFO  dispatch id=SHP-1001 carrier=FedEx wt=19.2kg dest=\"Madrid\"\n2026-09-14T21:07:58Z DEBUG heartbeat worker=w50 ok\n2026-09-21T05:17:28Z INFO  queue depth=1\n2026-09-14T15:56:11Z INFO  queue depth=56\n2026-09-22T02:42:33Z DEBUG gc pause 9ms\n2026-09-19T08:54:03Z INFO  sync inventory batch=36 rows=0\n2026-09-16T08:41:47Z WARN  label printer p89 low on paper\n2026-09-14T18:40:21Z INFO  dispatch id=SHP-1002 carrier=DHL Express wt=28.1kg dest=\"Porto\"\n2026-09-14T14:25:47Z INFO  sync inventory batch=11 rows=0\n2026-09-14T20:59:09Z WARN  label printer p32 low on paper\n2026-09-14T17:10:10Z INFO  dispatch id=SHP-1003 carrier=DHL Express wt=20.3kg dest=\"Madrid\"\n2026-09-21T16:41:12Z WARN  label printer p32 low on paper\n2026-09-18T05:03:05Z INFO  sync inventory batch=86 rows=0\n2026-09-14T04:37:57Z DEBUG heartbeat worker=w60 ok\n2026-09-14T18:41:09Z INFO  dispatch id=SHP-1004 carrier=UPS wt=39.8kg dest=\"Ghent\"\n2026-09-15T15:42:59Z DEBUG gc pause 45ms\n2026-09-15T17:35:08Z INFO  queue depth=3\n2026-09-15T20:06:33Z DEBUG heartbeat worker=w96 ok\n2026-09-15T08:27:55Z INFO  dispatch id=SHP-1005 carrier=dhl wt=28.3kg dest=\"Ghent\"\n2026-09-14T20:27:46Z DEBUG gc pause 90ms\n2026-09-15T00:16:13Z INFO  queue depth=38\n2026-09-15T14:15:48Z INFO  dispatch id=SHP-1006